        note bottom of Farmer
            Old Garry: does not move (row 2, in front of the farm). His pitchfork reaches the square around him
            (team decision, D9): rows 1 to 3, from 0 to 3 cells from the farm; never the mole, which stays on the field.
            4 damage, 1 hit/s, read from EnemyConfig.
            D14 (Yohan): each hit turns him toward his target (getFacing, the largest gap decides: the row, or
            in front of / behind him) and starts his attack pose, 0.3 s (isAttacking). EAST before the first hit, and
            again when no enemy is in play any more. FarmRenderer reads both, without knowing the type of the target.
        end note
