    package com.cropa {
        class CropaGame {
            +CropaGame(language : Language)
            +create():void
        }
        note bottom of CropaGame
            Entry point started by libGDX. Extends libGDX's Game, which can switch screens (setScreen).
            The launcher gives the language to start in (desktop: the language of the computer; web: "?lang=" in
            the address, or else the language of the browser).
            create: creates the game (the model's GameSession, with GameConfig and Random) and opens GameScreen,
            with the title screen (startNewGame(true)).
            "Rejouer": startNewGame(false) (private) creates the session and the screen again, without the title screen,
            then disposes of the previous screen.
            Language button of the title screen: switchLanguage (private) takes the other language and starts over
            with the title screen.
        end note
    }
